These classes test how the ComponentSpecProcessor generates the DeleteSpec.Builder 
registrations.

Two styles of the DeleteSpec.Builder are supported: 
- fully generified 
- without (much of) generics

The annotation processor should work for both forms, and should recognize 
deleteBuilder() and builder() methods on *Spec and *DeleteSpec respectively.

TestResource2Spec is intentionally implemented as an abstract class that identifies its Delete spec 
and that definition is inherited into concrete subclasses. This inheritance is checked by tests.